OL,3,GNEWSASurvivor, 102, recalls tragedy
OL,4,Athat killed 464 men
OL,5,
OL,6,FEskdale's story has now been preserved
OL,7,Fin a documentary made with the help of
OL,8,Fhis nine-year-old great-granddaughter,
OL,9,FOlive, helping pass his memories to a
OL,10,Fnew generation.
